%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'sequence': {'actorMargin': 150, 'messageMargin': 60}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Employee
    participant FE as React Client
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant ORD as Order Service
    participant INV as Inventory Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 1: Order Creation
    U->>+FE: createOrder(customerId, items)
    FE->>+API: POST /api/orders
    API->>+ORD: process_new_order(customerId, items)
    ORD->>+DB: SELECT * FROM customers WHERE id = :customerId
    DB-->>-ORD: Customer Record
    ORD->>+DB: INSERT INTO orders, order_items
    DB-->>-ORD: Order Created ID
    ORD-->>-API: return Order(Pending)
    API-->>-FE: 201 Created (Order)
    FE-->>-U: showOrderSummary()

    Note over U,DB: PHASE 2: Order Confirmation & Stock Deduction
    U->>+FE: confirmOrder(orderId)
    FE->>+API: PATCH /api/orders/{id}/status (Confirmed)
    API->>+ORD: confirm_order(orderId)
    
    ORD->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    loop For each OrderItem
        ORD->>+INV: check_stock_availability(productId, qty)
        INV->>+DB: SELECT stock_qty FROM products
        DB-->>-INV: Current Stock
        alt Insufficient Stock
            INV-->>ORD: throw InsufficientStockError()
            ORD->>DB: ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
            ORD-->>API: throw BadRequest("Stock not available")
            API-->>FE: 400 Bad Request
            FE-->>U: showError("Insufficient Stock")
        else Stock OK
            INV->>+DB: UPDATE products SET stock_qty = stock_qty - qty
            DB-->>-INV: Rows Affected
            INV->>+DB: INSERT INTO inventory_movements
            DB-->>-INV: Rows Affected
            INV-->>-ORD: return True
        end
    end
    ORD->>+DB: UPDATE orders SET status = 'Confirmed'
    DB-->>-ORD: Rows Affected
    ORD->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    ORD-->>-API: return Order(Confirmed)
    API-->>-FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>-U: updateDashboard()
